<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link href="/css/cssdir/out.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" integrity="sha384-iw3OoTErCYJJB9mCa8LNS2hbsQ7M3C0EpIsO/H5+EGAkPGc6rk+V8i04oW/K5xq0" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <title>Engenharia & Comunidade — Manager Bot</title>
</head>

<body class="bg-[#090a0f] text-slate-200 min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans selection:bg-indigo-500 selection:text-white antialiased overflow-x-hidden">
    
    <!-- Background Decorators -->
    <div class="fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none bg-[#090a0f] bg-blueprint"></div>
    <div class="fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[1000px] h-[350px] bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_rgba(88,101,242,0.12),_transparent_70%)]"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <header class="fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 bg-[#090a0f]/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-white/[0.08] transition-all duration-300">
        <nav class="container mx-auto flex items-center justify-between p-4 lg:px-8" aria-label="Global">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
                    <div class="relative w-9 h-9 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shadow-sm group-hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition-colors">
                        <img class="w-full h-full object-cover" src="/res/serverIcon/boticon.jpg" alt="Bot Icon">
                    </div>
                    <span class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg tracking-tight text-white group-hover:text-slate-200 transition-colors">Manager Bot</span>
                </a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center lg:gap-x-1 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full">
                <a href="/auth/docs" class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/[0.05] transition-all duration-150">Documentação</a>
                <a href="/auth/funcutils" class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/[0.05] transition-all duration-150">Módulos & Funções</a>
                <a href="/auth/about" class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/[0.05] transition-all duration-150">Arquitetura</a>
                <a href="/auth/devs" class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-white/[0.08] transition-all duration-150">Comunidade</a>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <a href="/auth/discord" class="btn-studio-primary text-xs sm:text-sm !py-2 sm:!py-2.5 !px-4 sm:!px-5 rounded-xl">
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-discord text-base"></i>
                    <span>Acessar Painel</span>
                </a>
                <button type="button" onclick="toggleNavMenu()" class="lg:hidden p-2 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-slate-300 hover:text-white" aria-label="Menu">
                    <i id="nav-toggle-icon" class="fa-solid fa-bars text-lg"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </nav>
        <div id="mobile-nav-dropdown" class="hidden lg:hidden border-t border-white/5 bg-[#090a0f]/95 backdrop-blur-2xl px-6 py-5 space-y-2">
            <a href="/auth/docs" class="block py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-all">Documentação</a>
            <a href="/auth/funcutils" class="block py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-all">Módulos & Funções</a>
            <a href="/auth/about" class="block py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-all">Arquitetura</a>
            <a href="/auth/devs" class="block py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-white bg-white/[0.08] transition-all">Comunidade</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <main class="relative z-10 flex-grow pt-28 sm:pt-36 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full">
        <div class="mb-12 border-b border-white/[0.08] pb-8">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] text-slate-300 text-xs font-mono mb-4">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-code text-indigo-400"></i>
                <span>Open Source & Ecossistema</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-3">
                Engenharia & Desenvolvimento
            </h1>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-400 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
                Conheça os padrões técnicos, bibliotecas e princípios adotados na construção do Manager Bot e de seu painel web.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-8">
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
                
                <div class="panel-elevated rounded-2xl p-6">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 mb-4">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-base"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1.5">Eficiência & Escala</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                        Consultas otimizadas com índices compostos no MongoDB e economia de cotas no YouTube para suportar centenas de servidores sem lentidão.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="panel-elevated rounded-2xl p-6">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 mb-4">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-hand-pointer text-base"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1.5">Ergonomia Web</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                        Ações imediatas no painel sem recarregar a tela: feedback em tempo real através de Toasts e requisições assíncronas JSON.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="panel-elevated rounded-2xl p-6">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 mb-4">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-lock text-base"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1.5">Segurança Estrita</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                        Autenticação direta com a API do Discord, validação canônica de IDs contra injeção e proteção baseada nos cargos dos administradores.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>

            <!-- Contribuição & Suporte -->
            <div class="panel-elevated rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-3">Comunidade & Suporte</h3>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                    O Manager Bot é um projeto em contínua evolução técnica. Relate bugs, sugira melhorias na experiência de uso ou acompanhe os lançamentos diretamente com a equipe.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
                    <a href="https://discord.com/oauth2/authorize?client_id=1407885636135944342&permissions=2150755584&integration_type=0&scope=bot+applications.commands" 
                       class="btn-studio-primary text-xs !py-2.5 !px-5 rounded-xl">
                        <i class="fa-brands fa-discord"></i>
                        <span>Adicionar Bot</span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/auth/docs" class="btn-studio-secondary text-xs !py-2.5 !px-5 rounded-xl">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-book"></i>
                        <span>Consultar Documentação</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="border-t border-white/[0.06] py-8 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
        <p>Manager Bot © 2026 • Engenharia de Software</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        function toggleNavMenu() {
            const menu = document.getElementById("mobile-nav-dropdown");
            const icon = document.getElementById("nav-toggle-icon");
            if (!menu || !icon) return;
            const isHidden = menu.classList.contains("hidden");
            if (isHidden) {
                menu.classList.remove("hidden");
                icon.classList.remove("fa-bars");
                icon.classList.add("fa-xmark");
            } else {
                menu.classList.add("hidden");
                icon.classList.remove("fa-xmark");
                icon.classList.add("fa-bars");
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>